WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.602 --> 00:00:03.770
-Today was Joe Biden's
first full day as president,

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:05.638
and as and set to work
cleaning up the mess

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:06.973
left by his predecessor,

00:00:06.973 --> 00:00:09.709
Republicans predictably
lost their minds.

00:00:09.709 --> 00:00:12.312
For more on this, it's time for
"A Closer Look."

00:00:15.949 --> 00:00:18.718
It is very hard to overstate
the sheer magnitude

00:00:18.718 --> 00:00:21.287
of the crisis left behind
by the Trump administration.

00:00:21.287 --> 00:00:23.489
It's unprecedented
in our lifetimes

00:00:23.489 --> 00:00:25.125
and in modern
American history.

00:00:25.125 --> 00:00:27.293
And in the short term,
it's only getting worse.

00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:29.529
For one thing, Biden inherited
the worst economy

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:30.930
since the Great Depression.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:34.367
And as we learned this morning,
900,000 Americans filed

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:36.268
for jobless claims
last week,

00:00:36.268 --> 00:00:39.072
which means this is now
the second time in 12 years

00:00:39.072 --> 00:00:40.940
Biden has been part of
an administration

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:43.943
that inherited an economy
in smoldering ruins

00:00:43.943 --> 00:00:45.344
from a Republican
predecessor.

00:00:45.344 --> 00:00:48.414
Biden's like the grandpa who
sits quietly in the recliner

00:00:48.414 --> 00:00:49.882
all day,
reading a newspaper,

00:00:49.882 --> 00:00:51.383
but then,
when it gets too cold,

00:00:51.383 --> 00:00:53.552
you have to ask him
to chop the firewood

00:00:53.552 --> 00:00:55.120
because no one else
knows how.

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:56.288
"Get out of the way, kid,

00:00:56.288 --> 00:00:58.191
you're gonna hurt yourself
with that ax.

00:00:58.191 --> 00:01:00.293
Now, why don't you
and your can noodle arms

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:02.528
go play some more
Minecraft."

00:01:02.528 --> 00:01:06.399
So, Biden started by signing a
total of 17 executive actions

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:07.933
on his first day in office
yesterday.

00:01:07.933 --> 00:01:10.603
And then, today, he discussed
his administration's

00:01:10.603 --> 00:01:13.072
COVID response,
and signed 10 more.

00:01:13.072 --> 00:01:16.376 line:0%
-Joe Biden already signing
17 executive orders,

00:01:16.376 --> 00:01:18.544 line:0%
some of them focusing on
the coronavirus.

00:01:18.544 --> 00:01:22.215 line:0%
10 more today, focusing
specifically on the pandemic.

00:01:22.215 --> 00:01:25.084 line:0%
-Moments ago,
the president also speaking,

00:01:25.084 --> 00:01:27.052 line:0%
signing those
executive actions

00:01:27.052 --> 00:01:29.788 line:0%
aimed at changing the course
of the pandemic in this country,

00:01:29.788 --> 00:01:32.258 line:0%
including
expanding testing,

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:36.495 line:0%
accelerating vaccinations,
and safely reopening schools.

00:01:36.495 --> 00:01:38.664
-As we indicated earlier,
we're gonna be signing

00:01:38.664 --> 00:01:42.067
a number of executive orders
over the next several days

00:01:42.067 --> 00:01:43.102
to a week,

00:01:43.102 --> 00:01:44.470
And I'm gonna start today,

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:49.041
as the compounding crisis
of COVID-19,

00:01:49.041 --> 00:01:51.411
along with the economic crisis
following that,

00:01:51.411 --> 00:01:55.381
the climate crisis,
racial equity issues.

00:01:55.381 --> 00:01:57.583
-So, you know, everything.

00:01:57.583 --> 00:01:59.986
Like coming home thinking you
had a table delivered,

00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:02.655
but it's just the pieces
for a table in a box.

00:02:02.655 --> 00:02:04.090
"Crap. Okay."

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:05.992
Allen wrench time, Joe.

00:02:05.992 --> 00:02:07.626
And that was just
the first round,

00:02:07.626 --> 00:02:10.196
to undue heinous Trump policies
like the Muslim ban

00:02:10.196 --> 00:02:11.397
and the Keystone Pipeline,

00:02:11.397 --> 00:02:13.065
and stop construction
of the border wall,

00:02:13.065 --> 00:02:14.099
among other things.

00:02:14.099 --> 00:02:15.902
Biden also reentered
the U.S.

00:02:15.902 --> 00:02:17.403
into the Paris
Climate Agreement,

00:02:17.403 --> 00:02:19.138
which basically
sets goals

00:02:19.138 --> 00:02:20.974
for limiting greenhouse
gas emissions.

00:02:20.974 --> 00:02:23.676
It's the bare minimum we can do
to address climate change,

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:25.778
since large parts of the country
were, you know,

00:02:25.778 --> 00:02:27.679
on fire for most
of the summer.

00:02:27.679 --> 00:02:31.517
And yet, Texas Senator Ted Cruz
cannot help but weigh in

00:02:31.517 --> 00:02:33.486
with a stunningly
stupid retort.

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:35.255 line:0%
-The Texas Senator tweeted,
quote,

00:02:35.255 --> 00:02:37.290 line:0%
"By rejoining the Paris
Climate Agreement,

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:40.426 line:0%
President Biden indicates he's
more interested in the views

00:02:40.426 --> 00:02:42.361 line:0%
of the citizens of Paris

00:02:42.361 --> 00:02:44.997 line:0%
than in the jobs
of the citizens of Pittsburgh."

00:02:44.997 --> 00:02:48.100
-Well, I guess, with Trump gone,
there was an opening

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:52.004
for a new wildly objectionable
kazoo-voiced [bleep] heel.

00:02:52.004 --> 00:02:54.273
Look, I know he just recycled
this line from Trump,

00:02:54.273 --> 00:02:56.342
but it was dumb them,
and it's even dumber now.

00:02:56.342 --> 00:02:59.679
For one thing, the Paris Climate
Accord isn't about Paris.

00:02:59.679 --> 00:03:01.614
It was signed in Paris.

00:03:01.614 --> 00:03:02.915
Are you really
this stupid?

00:03:02.915 --> 00:03:04.984
Is your beard growing
into your brain?

00:03:04.984 --> 00:03:07.419
Does Ted Cruz also think
New York Fashion Week

00:03:07.419 --> 00:03:08.954
is about
New York fashion?

00:03:08.954 --> 00:03:10.723
"And coming down
the runway now,

00:03:10.723 --> 00:03:13.960
it's a delivery guy wearing
headphones on an electronic bike

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:17.096
who will not stop
for red lights."

00:03:17.096 --> 00:03:20.833
Now, I should clarify,
Ted Cruz isn't that stupid.

00:03:20.833 --> 00:03:24.570
He's a scheming, festering,
gym sock full of mayonnaise

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:27.006
who knows full well
that the city of Pittsburgh

00:03:27.006 --> 00:03:29.375
voluntarily followed
the Paris Agreement

00:03:29.375 --> 00:03:31.310
even after
Trump withdrew.

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:33.946
And personally, I think Ted Cruz
is the last person

00:03:33.946 --> 00:03:36.516
who should pretend
to stick up for Pittsburgh,

00:03:36.516 --> 00:03:39.118
since he just tried
to throw out the votes

00:03:39.118 --> 00:03:40.986
of everyone who lives
in Pittsburgh.

00:03:40.986 --> 00:03:44.991
Have you no shame, you
microwaved Aquaman Funko Pop?

00:03:44.991 --> 00:03:47.393
And look, is my dad's from
there, so I'm biased,

00:03:47.393 --> 00:03:50.529
but I hate that the core of this
is that Paris is fancy

00:03:50.529 --> 00:03:52.498
and Pittsburgh
is blue collar,

00:03:52.498 --> 00:03:54.667
when anyone who's been
to both places

00:03:54.667 --> 00:03:57.002
knows the 'burgh
is just as pretty --

00:03:57.002 --> 00:03:58.604
if not prettier --
than Paris.

00:03:58.604 --> 00:04:00.540
We've got more bridges
than Venice,

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:02.508
three rivers
to Paris' one,

00:04:02.508 --> 00:04:05.444
and last I checked,
you ain't gonna fine no incline

00:04:05.444 --> 00:04:07.080
in the City of Lights.

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:09.315
So, Ted Cruz,
to use the local parlance

00:04:09.315 --> 00:04:13.820
of my father's ancestral land,
you're a jagoff.

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:16.088
President Biden also reversed
Trump's decision

00:04:16.088 --> 00:04:17.756
to leave the World
Health Organization

00:04:17.756 --> 00:04:19.291
in the middle of
a deadly pandemic.

00:04:19.291 --> 00:04:22.395
And today, Biden's new chief
medical adviser,

00:04:22.395 --> 00:04:23.929
Dr. Anthony Fauci,

00:04:23.929 --> 00:04:26.499
announced that the U.S.
would remain in the WHO.

00:04:26.499 --> 00:04:30.069
And later in the day, he spoke
to the press at the White House.

00:04:30.069 --> 00:04:34.974
-I am honored to announce
that the United States

00:04:34.974 --> 00:04:40.012
will remain a member of
the World Health Organization.

00:04:40.012 --> 00:04:43.883
Yesterday, President Biden
signed the letters

00:04:43.883 --> 00:04:48.287
retracting the previous
administration's announcement

00:04:48.287 --> 00:04:50.489
to withdraw from
the organization.

00:04:50.489 --> 00:04:53.425 line:0%
The idea that you can
get up here,

00:04:53.425 --> 00:04:56.862 line:0%
and talk about what you know,
what the evidence is,

00:04:56.862 --> 00:04:59.398 line:0%
what the science is,
and know that's it.

00:04:59.398 --> 00:05:01.000 line:0%
Let the science speak.

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.969 line:0%
It is somewhat of
a liberating feeling.

00:05:02.969 --> 00:05:05.671 line:0%
-Basically vanished for a --
for a few months,

00:05:05.671 --> 00:05:07.072 line:0%
there, for a while.

00:05:07.072 --> 00:05:09.175 line:0%
Do you feel like
you're back now?

00:05:09.175 --> 00:05:10.943 line:0%
-I think so.

00:05:10.943 --> 00:05:12.812
-Yesterday must have been
amazing for Fauci.

00:05:12.812 --> 00:05:14.580
I picture him
waltzing down the block

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:16.315
of his old Brooklyn
neighborhood,

00:05:16.315 --> 00:05:18.984
heads popping out of windows
like a Neil Simon play.

00:05:18.984 --> 00:05:20.253
"Hey, it's Fauci.

00:05:20.253 --> 00:05:21.521
Yo, Facui!"

00:05:21.521 --> 00:05:23.288
"That's right, baby,
I'm back!

00:05:23.288 --> 00:05:24.690
I'll meet you down
in Mickey's!

00:05:24.690 --> 00:05:28.127
Next round of vaccines
are on Tony the Fauc!"

00:05:28.127 --> 00:05:29.595
Fauci's unchained,
everybody.

00:05:29.595 --> 00:05:31.897
He's unmuzzled.
He's finally free.

00:05:31.897 --> 00:05:35.134
He doesn't have to hide
behind his hand anymore.

00:05:35.134 --> 00:05:37.036
Probably had to peel
that thing off this morning,

00:05:37.036 --> 00:05:38.771
and then scrub off
the handprint

00:05:38.771 --> 00:05:41.541
like a frat guy who woke up
with Sharpie on his face.

00:05:41.541 --> 00:05:43.976
So, the scale
of the problems we're facing

00:05:43.976 --> 00:05:45.244
cannot be overstated.

00:05:45.244 --> 00:05:47.680
The U.S. set
yet another new record

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:50.583
for daily coronavirus deaths
on Trump's last day in office,

00:05:50.583 --> 00:05:53.051
millions out of work,
facing homelessness,

00:05:53.051 --> 00:05:54.586
child hunger
on the rise,

00:05:54.586 --> 00:05:57.423
not to mention the structural
inequalities that existed

00:05:57.423 --> 00:05:59.625
before Trump that got worse
during his presidency.

00:05:59.625 --> 00:06:01.527
Trump left office yesterday

00:06:01.527 --> 00:06:04.463
with 3 million fewer jobs
than when he started.

00:06:04.463 --> 00:06:07.699
Meanwhile, Wall Street added
56 new billionaires

00:06:07.699 --> 00:06:09.335
just since
the pandemic began.

00:06:09.335 --> 00:06:11.870
Billionaires have added
a $1 trillion in wealth

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:13.205
since the start
of the pandemic,

00:06:13.205 --> 00:06:15.908
including a group of just
10 billionaires alone

00:06:15.908 --> 00:06:18.344
who added more than $400 billion
to their wealth.

00:06:18.344 --> 00:06:21.780
That group includes
Jeff Bezos, Elon Musk,

00:06:21.780 --> 00:06:23.549
Larry Page,
and Mark Zuckerberg --

00:06:23.549 --> 00:06:25.417
who, despite the increase
in his wealth,

00:06:25.417 --> 00:06:28.054
apparently still doesn't have
enough money to get a haircut

00:06:28.054 --> 00:06:29.989
that doesn't make them
look like Data

00:06:29.989 --> 00:06:32.357
playing a Roman emperor
on the holodeck.

00:06:32.357 --> 00:06:33.826
"TNG" deep cut.

00:06:33.826 --> 00:06:36.195
Personally, I can't wait for
incoming Senate budget chair,

00:06:36.195 --> 00:06:37.562
and tonight's guest,
Bernie Sanders,

00:06:37.562 --> 00:06:38.864
to dig in,
and get to work on that.

00:06:38.864 --> 00:06:40.165
It's got to be
his life's dream

00:06:40.165 --> 00:06:41.300
and the billionaire's
worst nightmare.

00:06:41.300 --> 00:06:43.436
For one thing,
no one's better suited

00:06:43.436 --> 00:06:47.740
to be in charge of a budget than
a guy who has one solid coat,

00:06:47.740 --> 00:06:49.408
and that's it.

00:06:49.408 --> 00:06:51.143
You know how,
when winter rolls around

00:06:51.143 --> 00:06:52.311
and you look
in your closet,

00:06:52.311 --> 00:06:53.546
and they are, like,
six different jackets

00:06:53.546 --> 00:06:55.314
of varying sizes
and thickness.

00:06:55.314 --> 00:06:57.716
That doesn't happen
to Bernie.

00:06:57.716 --> 00:07:01.053
He has one coat that he wears
from October to February.

00:07:01.053 --> 00:07:03.456
And if it's cold
any other time of the year,

00:07:03.456 --> 00:07:06.091
he just does a lap
around the Capitol.

00:07:06.091 --> 00:07:07.960
Then, there's the fact
that the vaccine rollout,

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:09.562
which we've had months
to prepare for,

00:07:09.562 --> 00:07:11.930
and which could finally end
the pandemic,

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:12.999
has been a disaster.

00:07:12.999 --> 00:07:14.433
In some cases,
vaccines are literally

00:07:14.433 --> 00:07:16.869
getting thrown in the garbage,
which is just horrifying.

00:07:16.869 --> 00:07:18.771
I mean, just give them away.
Give them to anyone.

00:07:18.771 --> 00:07:21.340
Don't make me rifle through
the dumpster behind a CVS

00:07:21.340 --> 00:07:23.142
looking for another vial
that says "Pfizer,"

00:07:23.142 --> 00:07:25.077
because I will do it again.

00:07:25.077 --> 00:07:27.112
At this point,
I'm gonna buy a knockoff vaccine

00:07:27.112 --> 00:07:29.581
from one of the guys
selling bags in Times Square --

00:07:29.581 --> 00:07:31.717
which will make sense,
as Pfizer

00:07:31.717 --> 00:07:34.620
already looks like
a knockoff spelling.

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:36.956
Now, you might have expected
that, when Biden took office,

00:07:36.956 --> 00:07:38.490
he would at least inherit
from Trump

00:07:38.490 --> 00:07:40.058
a vaccine plan
that was bad,

00:07:40.058 --> 00:07:41.360
or incomplete,
or both,

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:42.628
but it's even worse
than that.

00:07:42.628 --> 00:07:45.197 line:0%
It turns out there was actually
no plan at all.

00:07:45.197 --> 00:07:47.566 line:0%
-Brand-new reporting
about the vaccine rollout,

00:07:47.566 --> 00:07:50.369 line:0%
and it is much worse
than we thought.

00:07:50.369 --> 00:07:53.873 line:0%
Sources tell CNN that the Biden
administration is inheriting

00:07:53.873 --> 00:07:57.209 line:0%
a non-existent
vaccine distribution plan

00:07:57.209 --> 00:07:58.477 line:0%
from the Trump
administration.

00:07:58.477 --> 00:08:00.112 line:0%
-One source telling CNN, quote,

00:08:00.112 --> 00:08:02.547 line:0%
"There is nothing
for us to rework.

00:08:02.547 --> 00:08:05.718 line:0%
We are going to have to build
everything from scratch."

00:08:05.718 --> 00:08:06.953
-This is criminal.

00:08:06.953 --> 00:08:08.720
I mean, my God,
they knew this was coming,

00:08:08.720 --> 00:08:10.022
and they did nothing.

00:08:10.022 --> 00:08:12.691
Was the point of Warp Speed
to go as fast as possible

00:08:12.691 --> 00:08:14.660
before crashing into
a brick wall?

00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:16.662
The Trump administration
had a year,

00:08:16.662 --> 00:08:18.597
and they didn't even sit down
and draw up a plan.

00:08:18.597 --> 00:08:20.766
Was coronavirus task force
leader Mike Pence

00:08:20.766 --> 00:08:22.835
in cold storage
during that whole time?

00:08:22.835 --> 00:08:26.438
Did Dr. Birx get lost
in a pile of scarves?

00:08:26.438 --> 00:08:27.807
Although, in a way,

00:08:27.807 --> 00:08:29.708
I guess it's better
to just write your own plan

00:08:29.708 --> 00:08:31.243
than have to rework
whatever the hell

00:08:31.243 --> 00:08:32.244
Trump would have
come up with.

00:08:32.244 --> 00:08:33.813
It's like fixing
a birthday cake

00:08:33.813 --> 00:08:35.781
after putting your kid in charge
of making it.

00:08:35.781 --> 00:08:37.415
I mean, you can add
as much sugar as you want,

00:08:37.415 --> 00:08:40.418
but there's nothing you can do
about that ketchup icing.

00:08:40.418 --> 00:08:42.555
So, Biden and Democrats
in the Senate have a series

00:08:42.555 --> 00:08:44.390
of truly daunting challenges
in front of them.

00:08:44.390 --> 00:08:47.393
Not to mention, they also have
to hold the previous president

00:08:47.393 --> 00:08:50.529
and his allies accountable for
inciting a violent insurrection,

00:08:50.529 --> 00:08:52.197
and investigate
what happened.

00:08:52.197 --> 00:08:53.566
Just in the last
24 hours,

00:08:53.566 --> 00:08:56.268
we've learned that the Army
lied about the involvement

00:08:56.268 --> 00:08:57.436
of Michael Flynn's brother

00:08:57.436 --> 00:08:59.171
in the military response
to the riot,

00:08:59.171 --> 00:09:02.008
and a Republican congressman
has said the insurrection

00:09:02.008 --> 00:09:04.343
was much worse
than the public realized.

00:09:04.343 --> 00:09:06.579
All that information needs to
come out, and be investigated,

00:09:06.579 --> 00:09:09.081
not to mention all the other
simultaneous crises

00:09:09.081 --> 00:09:10.148
we've already mentioned.

00:09:10.148 --> 00:09:11.316
By Biden's own admission,

00:09:11.316 --> 00:09:12.951
the executive orders
are just a first step --

00:09:12.951 --> 00:09:16.422 line:0%
a first step that, predictably,
has Fox News losing its mind.

00:09:16.422 --> 00:09:19.491 line:0%
Joe Biden said yesterday,
"I want unity."

00:09:19.491 --> 00:09:20.926 line:0%
He talked about that
in his speech.

00:09:20.926 --> 00:09:23.596 line:0%
But the first thing he does,
the first order of business,

00:09:23.596 --> 00:09:26.065 line:0%
is to walk in,
sit down at the table,

00:09:26.065 --> 00:09:28.868 line:0%
and he has 17
executive orders

00:09:28.868 --> 00:09:31.970 line:0%
really wiping away much of
what President Trump did.

00:09:31.970 --> 00:09:34.940 line:0%
-They had all those
executive orders ready to go.

00:09:34.940 --> 00:09:37.276 line:0%
The immigration ones
particularly stuck out.

00:09:37.276 --> 00:09:39.712 line:0%
What did you think?

00:09:39.712 --> 00:09:41.147 line:0%
-Well, I was mystified.

00:09:41.147 --> 00:09:44.716 line:0%
In fact, my question is,
"What the heck is going on?"

00:09:44.716 --> 00:09:48.120 line:0%
-The weak, the frail,
the cognitively struggling Biden

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:50.523 line:0%
signing this flurry
of executive orders.

00:09:50.523 --> 00:09:52.958
-I'm sorry.
You think Biden is frail

00:09:52.958 --> 00:09:54.359
and cognitively struggling?

00:09:54.359 --> 00:09:55.861
The guy you supported
for the last four years

00:09:55.861 --> 00:09:57.663
thought windmills
caused cancer,

00:09:57.663 --> 00:09:59.632
read his own speeches
off a teleprompter

00:09:59.632 --> 00:10:02.401
like he was trying to follow
the subtitles of foreign film,

00:10:02.401 --> 00:10:03.802
and clutched the podium

00:10:03.802 --> 00:10:05.437
the way a grandpa clutches
the steering wheel

00:10:05.437 --> 00:10:07.372
when he drives through
midtown Manhattan.

00:10:07.372 --> 00:10:09.908 line:0%
Biden was literally jogging over
to reporters

00:10:09.908 --> 00:10:11.210 line:0%
at the inauguration yesterday

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:13.879 line:0%
like a marathon runner
who comes in dead last

00:10:13.879 --> 00:10:16.549 line:0%
because he won't stop
taking selfies with the crowd.

00:10:16.549 --> 00:10:18.317
Also, Karl Rove,
why are you still on TV?

00:10:18.317 --> 00:10:20.753
And why are you still toting
around that stupid whiteboard?

00:10:20.753 --> 00:10:22.755
If you're not gonna slink
away in shame and disgrace

00:10:22.755 --> 00:10:24.156
the way you should,
at least get a new gig.

00:10:24.156 --> 00:10:26.958
I mean, even Carrot Top
changed his hair for a while.

00:10:26.958 --> 00:10:28.761
In fact, Republicans
are already plotting

00:10:28.761 --> 00:10:31.030
to do everything possible
to stall the Democrats' agenda,

00:10:31.030 --> 00:10:33.465
which includes a proposed
$1.9 trillion

00:10:33.465 --> 00:10:35.167
stimulus and
healthcare package

00:10:35.167 --> 00:10:37.569
and a raft of desperately
needed voting reforms.

00:10:37.569 --> 00:10:39.504
Mitch McConnell
and other Republicans

00:10:39.504 --> 00:10:41.440
are demanding that new
Senate majority leader,

00:10:41.440 --> 00:10:44.076
Chuck Schumer, commit to keeping
the filibuster,

00:10:44.076 --> 00:10:47.812
which is insane because, even if
Democrats don't get rid of it --

00:10:47.812 --> 00:10:49.348
which they
absolutely should --

00:10:49.348 --> 00:10:52.284
just the threat of getting rid
of it can be very powerful.

00:10:52.284 --> 00:10:55.320
If you walk around Prospect Park
with a katana,

00:10:55.320 --> 00:10:56.622
you don't actually
need to use it.

00:10:56.622 --> 00:10:58.490
People are gonna, you know,
stay out of your way.

00:10:58.490 --> 00:11:01.026
And now, even moderate Democrats
are pissed at McConnell

00:11:01.026 --> 00:11:03.462
and the GOP for making
such a ridiculous demand.

00:11:03.462 --> 00:11:05.531
Montana Senator Jon Tester
told Politico,

00:11:05.531 --> 00:11:07.366
"Chuck Schumer
is the majority leader,

00:11:07.366 --> 00:11:09.468
and he should be treated
like the majority leader.

00:11:09.468 --> 00:11:10.869
We can get [bleep] done
around here,

00:11:10.869 --> 00:11:13.138
and we ought to be focused
on getting stuff done."

00:11:13.138 --> 00:11:15.107
First of all, it's awesome
when someone says [bleep]

00:11:15.107 --> 00:11:16.642
for "stuff" the first time,

00:11:16.642 --> 00:11:20.012
and then just switches
back to "stuff."

00:11:20.012 --> 00:11:22.648
I am very down from more cursing
from Senate Democrats.

00:11:22.648 --> 00:11:24.349
They might as well
take a cue from Tester,

00:11:24.349 --> 00:11:25.684
and call their first bill

00:11:25.684 --> 00:11:28.086
"The Get [Bleep] Done Act
of 20[bleep]21."

00:11:28.086 --> 00:11:30.355
Second, he's right.
You guys lost.

00:11:30.355 --> 00:11:32.625
Some of you even tried
to overthrow democracy.

00:11:32.625 --> 00:11:34.393
You don't get
to make demands,

00:11:34.393 --> 00:11:37.196
and you don't get forgiven
just because it didn't work.

00:11:37.196 --> 00:11:39.464
When I tried to flip over
the table at Thanksgiving

00:11:39.464 --> 00:11:41.967
because no one complimented
my cajun green beans,

00:11:41.967 --> 00:11:44.570
only to realize the table
was way too heavy,

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:47.072
I didn't get to sit back down,
and pretend nothing happened.

00:11:47.072 --> 00:11:49.708
I had to go outside,
and to quote my wife.

00:11:49.708 --> 00:11:52.411
"think about the example
I'm setting for our kids."

00:11:52.411 --> 00:11:53.846
President Biden
and Democrats in Congress

00:11:53.846 --> 00:11:55.447
have a towering challenge
ahead of them.

00:11:55.447 --> 00:11:57.216
They have to fix both
what Trump broke

00:11:57.216 --> 00:11:59.317
and what was broken
before them,

00:11:59.317 --> 00:12:01.787
all while holding him
and his enablers accountable,

00:12:01.787 --> 00:12:04.689
as well as fixing
the conditions that created him.

00:12:04.689 --> 00:12:06.692
It's a tall order,
especially since they're dealing

00:12:06.692 --> 00:12:09.628
with a Republican Party
and right-wing media
that's run by...

00:12:09.628 --> 00:12:12.932 line:0%
-The weak, the frail,
the cognitively struggling.

00:12:12.932 --> 00:12:14.667
